1
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,320
- When we go up later...
- Mr. Wu,

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,640
- Please take care of him.
- Drink some more.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,160
I can't drink anymore.

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,240
I'm going back for a moment.

5
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,720
- What's wrong?
- I left my phone in the room.

6
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,720
Go with the director first.
I'll be there in a bit.

7
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,023
We'll be waiting for you.

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,720
Zhen Xin.

9
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,960
Motherfucker!

10
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,000
Fuck.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,600
Wu Rong.

12
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,720
Zhun.

13
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,940
You're awake?

14
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,960
Yes.

15
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,200
I'm awake.

16
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,600
What?

17
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,155
Then what are you two...

18
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,000
We're rehearsing a scene.

19
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,560
Rehearsing?

20
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,120
Right here?

21
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,000
At this hour?

22
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,060
It's true. We really are rehearsing.

23
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,600
Zhun, you're drunk.

24
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,043
Come with me.

25
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:17,100
He was actually awake.

26
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,580
Fuck.

27
00:02:45,762 --> 00:02:50,240
[Episode 4]

28
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:53,040
Wu Rong. Just now...

29
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,080
Well...

30
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,960
I think I left my key card in the private room.

31
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,960
I'll go back and get it.

32
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,740
Wait for me here.

33
00:02:59,866 --> 00:03:01,486
Wu Rong.

34
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,320
Don't hurt him.

35
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,780
Don't worry. I won't.

36
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,560
Want to fight?

37
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,000
Come on.

38
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,680
I'm right here.

39
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,800
Listen.

40
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:41,880
You'd better not have
any indecent thoughts about Zhun.

41
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,680
Or what?

42
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:46,400
My fists will cripple you.

43
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,640
I don't give a damn
if you're the Best Actor or not.

44
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,340
Fuck.

45
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,882
I didn't find it.

46
00:04:10,882 --> 00:04:13,240
Maybe... I left it in the room.

47
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,520
Look at my memory.

48
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,420
Wu Rong.

49
00:04:18,647 --> 00:04:21,767
I really was looking for the room key.

50
00:04:21,767 --> 00:04:23,040
We haven't had a chance

51
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,840
to chat like this in a long time.

52
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,620
How about we share the room tonight?

53
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,640
Okay.

54
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,540
Silly boy.

55
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,540
Where are you going?

56
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,720
The bed is too small for two.

57
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,280
I'll sleep on the sofa.

58
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,440
Oh.

59
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:57,320
Is it because my snoring bothers you?

60
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:59,900
My wife always complains, too.

61
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,220
I'll sleep on the sofa.

62
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,480
You just got injured today.

63
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:08,320
You need enough sleep to recover quickly.

64
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:09,880
No, Wu Rong.

65
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:12,400
I just feel a bit awkward.

66
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,920
Back when we were training,

67
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,600
a dozen of us were all crammed
onto one big bunk.

68
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,480
Didn't we all get through it?

69
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:21,600
Now you find it awkward?

70
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:25,860
Maybe I've gotten used to being alone.

71
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:28,800
Are you used to sleeping alone,

72
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:31,240
or just not used to sleeping with me?

73
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,640
No, Wu Rong.

74
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,040
Don't overthink it.

75
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,800
I'll sleep on the sofa.

76
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:38,460
Forget it. You're weak as a kitten.

77
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:43,620
Besides, I'm used to sleeping on the sofa.

78
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,960
My wife's temper...

79
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:49,820
She's much harder to please than Dan Yi.

80
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,920
Dan Yi has a good temper.

81
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,000
Women...

82
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:56,900
You only see their true temper after marriage.

83
00:06:58,040 --> 00:07:00,220
You two are getting married soon, right?

84
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,880
Zhun.

85
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,440
I read the script.

86
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,280
Gao Zhun's character background...

87
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,680
A single-parent family.

88
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,960
A very strict mother.

89
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,940
Why does it sound so familiar?

90
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,340
Yeah.

91
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,320
Zhun.

92
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,700
I feel like you've changed a bit.

93
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,000
Over these years...

94
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,720
Have you been having a hard time?

95
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,840
Wu Rong, I'm fine.

96
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:40,120
"I'm fine." You say that when you're hurt.

97
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,600
You say that when you have no work.

98
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:44,840
Even when your mother passed away,
you said you were fine.

99
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:47,520
Zhun, do you even see me as your friend?

100
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,880
Every time I ask you,

101
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:50,320
you're always like this.

102
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:53,620
It's not a disgrace to admit you're in pain.

103
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,520
Wu Rong, don't overthink it.

104
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:04,520
I... I'm really fine.

105
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,720
If you don't want to talk about it,

106
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,800
I won't ask anymore.

107
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:11,880
Anyway, this movie is a great opportunity.

108
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,600
Not only are you acting opposite Zhen Xin,

109
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,880
but you're also the lead.

110
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:17,000
Seize the chance and aim for an award.

111
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,393
Then your career's winter will be over.

112
00:08:19,393 --> 00:08:21,253
Don't worry, Wu Rong.

113
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:24,760
I'll work hard.

114
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,920
Yeah.

115
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,060
You have to.

116
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,720
Zhun.

117
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:32,046
Remember what I said.

118
00:08:32,046 --> 00:08:34,280
Acting is acting.

119
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,903
Life is life.

120
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:41,020
Besides, Dan Yi is still waiting for you.

121
00:08:50,019 --> 00:08:50,840
[Feng Yun Ting]

122
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,840
<i>Honey.</i>

123
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,820
<i>Why aren't you asleep? Miss me again?</i>

124
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:01,087
<i>Honey.</i>

125
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:05,000
Are you coming to visit the set or not?

126
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,440
<i>What's the rush?</i>

127
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:09,340
<i>Wait until I finish this campaign, okay?</i>

128
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:14,220
<i>I have to wait for my schedule to clear up.</i>

129
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:18,360
<i>I have a pretty long vacation coming up.</i>

130
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,480
<i>When that time comes,</i>

131
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,520
<i>I'll come stay with you, how's that?</i>

132
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,320
<i>I'll stay for a few extra days.</i>

133
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:26,640
<i>I've never been to Coconut City before.</i>

134
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:27,920
<i>Honey.</i>

135
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:30,880
<i>Why aren't you saying anything?</i>

136
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:33,360
<i>You're not mad, are you?</i>

137
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,960
<i>What are you doing, Honey?</i>

138
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,550
Shut up.

139
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,220
<i>Stop it.</i>

140
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:51,434
Director Chen, thank you
for your understanding and care.

141
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,400
Ms. Qin, are you done with your other scenes?

142
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,000
Yes, I am.

143
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,120
You have no idea.

144
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:59,680
They originally wanted me for two more days.

145
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:01,600
But I told them Director Chen
only gave me a day's worth of time,

146
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,360
and that he was already being very generous.

147
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:06,760
Right? So, I rushed back overnight.

148
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,880
Don't worry, Director Chen.

149
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:11,040
I won't delay the progress here.

150
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,280
Good.

151
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,400
Get me a cup of coffee later.

152
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:16,000
Sure.

153
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:21,160
Just perform as usual in today's scene.

154
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:23,640
No problem, Director Chen.

155
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,760
I have full confidence in your acting.

156
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,680
It's all thanks to your guidance.

157
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,600
Go to the dressing room and wait for me.

158
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,760
You...

159
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,360
Were you okay yesterday?

160
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:43,140
I'm fine.

161
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,440
Where's Wu Rong?

162
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,120
He doesn't have any scenes this morning.

163
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:49,860
He was still sleeping when I left.

164
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,360
You two slept together?

165
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:58,760
Wu Rong and I...
haven't seen each other in a long time.

166
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,800
We were just catching up.

167
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:02,088
He slept on the sofa.

168
00:11:07,393 --> 00:11:09,333
Wu Rong didn't mean any harm.

169
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,320
He just cares too much.

170
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,180
He was just a bit impulsive.

171
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:18,320
Zhang Zhun, come here for a second.

172
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,840
Okay.

173
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:22,180
I'll head over there then.

174
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,093
I care, too.

175
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:33,438
What?

176
00:11:33,438 --> 00:11:35,000
Nothing.

177
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,900
I said, focus on your acting.

178
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,020
Charles.

179
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,440
I'm so happy to see you.

180
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,480
I didn't expect you to come.

181
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,880
Think of it as a bonus service.

182
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:04,640
Dr. Fang.

183
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,620
That's a nice tie.

184
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,120
Thank you.

185
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,820
I really like this one.

186
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:19,800
All right.

187
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,520
We're here to see the exhibition together.

188
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:22,680
Let's just relax.

189
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:24,360
I don't want to hear your awkward flattery.

190
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,703
Let's go.

191
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:30,140
Come on.

192
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,591
These sculptures...

193
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:49,346
are very unique.

194
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,400
It's a specific style.

195
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:54,094
Modernism.

196
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:07,846
From an artist's perspective,

197
00:13:07,846 --> 00:13:10,760
do you think the male body is more beautiful,

198
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,780
or the female body?

199
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:18,500
I drew people every day in art school.

200
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,280
I got sick of it.

201
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:23,973
In my eyes, men and women

202
00:13:23,973 --> 00:13:26,055
are no different at all.

203
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,554
It seems...

204
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:33,054
you pursue pure aesthetics.

205
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:38,520
Not just aesthetics.

206
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:40,102
But also...

207
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,551
love.

208
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,927
Dr. Fang.

209
00:13:55,927 --> 00:13:57,787
What are you...

210
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,980
How is your relationship with Lin Lin lately?

211
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,180
You...

212
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,560
Did you notice

213
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:14,260
that we're about to break up?

214
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,862
Why?

215
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,620
I...

216
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:24,440
I can't satisfy her.

217
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:26,300
In what way?

218
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:31,732
So, this is where you two snuck off to.

219
00:14:31,732 --> 00:14:33,320
How ungentlemanly.

220
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:36,680
I only went to the bathroom,
and you didn't even wait for me.

221
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,840
Sorry.

222
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:39,400
I was just so captivated.

223
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:41,820
I didn't even realize.

224
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,520
Excuse me.

225
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,760
I need to take this call.

226
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:50,660
You guys go ahead. I'll find you in a bit.

227
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,720
Hello, Justin.

228
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,160
Give me a second.

229
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:59,360
Let him talk. Let's go.

230
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,800
Zuo Lin Lin.

231
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:05,320
I don't want him to get the wrong idea.

232
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,860
Justin.

233
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,800
I don't like this arrangement.

234
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:16,080
Can't you just follow my work schedule?

235
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:19,960
Do you remember that exhibition in New York?

236
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:22,120
It was a lot like today.

237
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,760
Who is Mr. Gao calling?

238
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:26,040
Justin.

239
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:27,880
One of his subordinates.

240
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:29,160
To be honest,

241
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:30,880
I'm sick of hearing that name.

242
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:32,740
Subordinate?

243
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:36,200
Why do you care so much about him?

244
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:38,200
I can tell

245
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,760
that this subordinate

246
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:43,078
makes Mr. Gao nervous and uneasy.

247
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:46,920
What about me?

248
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:49,060
Do I make you nervous?

249
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,080
Charles, you're avoiding me.

250
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,840
Zuo Lin Lin.

251
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,040
Don't be like this.

252
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:58,160
You agreed to treat Gao Zhun

253
00:15:58,160 --> 00:16:00,640
because you couldn't let go of me, right?

254
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:02,740
This is inappropriate.

255
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:06,556
Have we ever cared about what's appropriate?

256
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,200
I know you hate me,

257
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:12,460
and that's why you can't forget me.

258
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:16,140
Charles.

259
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,980
Charles.

260
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,600
Charles.

261
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,600
- Lin Lin.
- Charles.

262
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:26,260
Follow the signs and meet us outside.

263
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,568
It's me.

264
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:38,580
Dr. Fang.

265
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,920
Close your eyes.

266
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:43,160
Dr. Fang.

267
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:45,048
Close your eyes.

268
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,900
Okay.

269
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:53,140
Now, do as I say.

270
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,920
Come on.

271
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:04,240
Breathe in.

272
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,680
One.

273
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,400
Two.

274
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:09,040
Three.

275
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,578
Breathe out.

276
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:14,840
You did well.

277
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,520
Now, we have to get out of here.

278
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,720
Don't go.

279
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,628
- Don't go.
- I'm here.

280
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,560
Please, Dr. Fang.

281
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:29,013
- Don't leave me.
- I'm not leaving you.

282
00:17:29,013 --> 00:17:30,320
Please, Dr. Fang.

283
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:32,160
- Don't...
- I just want to get you out of here.

284
